# Shared needs in the 100 requests

All 100 requests have an emitted program that passed the five original fixtures. The @CARDS@-card review bundle adds @COUNT@ verified bricks to the 104-card first batch. The interpretations, fields, source selectors, adapter code and acceptance examples were chosen manually. The miner and evaluator replay them without a model.

[Cumulative bundle](@BUNDLE@) · [Both clean-build manifests](@PAIR@/reproduction.json) · [All 100 final programs and fixture results](@REVIEW@/transfer/transfer.json) · [Binding comparison](@COMPARISON@/compare/comparison.json)

